            "content": "Here's what I found in Paris (ratings + prices):\n\n**🏨 Hotel — Good Night** ⭐ 5.0\n- Price range: €240–400/night\n- The other 5.0‑star option (Luxury Palace) starts at €500/night, so Good Night is the top‑rated *and* budget‑friendly pick. (Cheaper hotels exist — Montmartre Suites €110 @ 4.7, Le Marais Boutique €120 @ 4.2 — but their ratings are lower.)\n\n**🚗 Car Rental — Eiffel Tower Car Rental** ⭐ 5.0\n- €60/day (vs. Paris Rent‑a‑Car at €45/day but only 4.5 ⭐)\n\n**🍽️ Restaurant — Le Baratin** ⭐ 4.8\n- €30 per person — the highest‑rated restaurant on the list, while still mid‑priced (Breizh Café is €60 at only 3.9 ⭐; cheaper spots like Miznon €15 rate just 4.3 ⭐)\n\n### Minimum cost for a 3‑day trip\n| Item | Calculation | Cost |\n|---|---|---|\n| Hotel (3 nights) | 3 × €240 | €720 |\n| Car rental (3 days) | 3 × €60 | €180 |\n| Meals (2/day × 3 days = 6) | 6 × €30 | €180 |\n| **Total** | | **€1,080** |\n\n💡 If you'd rather save on the car, swapping to Paris Rent‑a‑Car (4.5 ⭐, €45/day) brings the trip down to **€1,035** — saving €45 for a ~0.5‑star drop in rating.\n\nWant me to go ahead and book any of these (and on which dates)?"
